  "description": "After being unadopted three times, Camellia is determined to stand on her own and applies for a position at the famous Bloomberry Tea Garden.\n\nThough there are unsavory rumors surrounding the owner, Brandon Worthing, the people of his estate treat her surprisingly well, as if she's a noble lady instead of a mere employee.\n\nBut regardless of these puzzling circumstances, Camellia flourishes in her new role as a tea maker, moving people's hearts with her special blends. Little does she know that there's a reason why Brandon hired her, and that their history goes back much further than she thought...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
